(window.StoryDialogue = window.StoryDialogue || {})["ac-9"] = {"468321101":[["Michaela","Radar response signals stopped one kilometer away, and there are quite a few."],["Michaela","Ha, they must be too exhausted to run now. The prey is already on its last legs, and now it's time for the hunter to take the stage!"],["","Even a fledgling mercenary group knows to cover their tracks when fleeing. I don't believe that a veteran like \"Wild Thorn\" would make such glaring mistakes in counter-surveillance."],["","Michaela put down the radar display and observed the distance. Some black dots could be faintly seen on the horizon, perhaps a cluster of old buildings."],["","Then she retreated into her Mithril's cockpit and closed the hatch to keep the heat out."],["Michaela","Do you fear this is a trap they've deliberately set?"],["","I'm fearless. I just think it's extremely unwise to knowingly jump into a pit."],["Michaela","Who said I'm going to jump into a pit? Ha! I would have buried them all."],["","......"],["Michaela","Don't believe me? Gutzman, last time you beat me was just a fluke... Tsk, saying it like that makes me sound like a sore loser, but I assure you, you haven't seen my true strength yet."],["Michaela","\"Wild Thorn\" dared to cross me, so they must face the consequences of breaking the rules."],["Gutzman","Since you have the support of Harpy, I certainly won't question your confidence."],["Michaela","What? Harpy?"],["Gutzman","What, those arm parts of yours must have come from Harpy, right?"],["Michaela","Ah—of course! You've seen their power too. With those treasures, \"Wild Thorns\" are no match."],["Gutzman","I remember that area up ahead used to be a mine. It should be abandoned. Not a bad place to lay an ambush."],["Gutzman","Never drop your guard during an operation. That's my advice."],["Michaela","In the face of absolute power, any ambush is just a death wish. See, I do advice, too—they're starting to move."],["","The red dots on the radar screen start flashing, scattering to farther places."],["Michaela","Chase them down, the hunt begins!"],["","Michaela led her troops at full speed, reaching the edge of the old mining zone in no time."],["Gutzman","They're fast. If we take a detour through the mining area to pursue them..."],["Michaela","We definitely won't make it in time. We have to go through the mining area."],["Gutzman","What if that's exactly what they want? If they've set up something in the mining area, we really won't be able to catch up to the \"Wild Thorns.\""],["Michaela","Ha, they actually think they can outsmart me..."],["","Michaela thinks for a moment."],["Michaela","No, we've already lost the initiative no matter what we choose. We can't let those \"Wild Thorns\" guys succeed."],["Michaela","Let's take a gamble. We'll split into two groups. You take one group on the detour, and the rest will follow me into the mining area. I'll handle any ambushes."],["Gutzman","Me? Are you sure?"],["Michaela","Don't be so wishy-washy, Gutzman. I know what you're capable of, and I didn't invite you here just to be my advisor. Show me some spirit!"],["Gutzman","......"],["Gutzman","Understood, I'll do my best to intercept those guys."],["","Gutzman quickly led a group of ST units and parted ways with Michaela, disappearing into the swirling red dust."],["","The pit is silent, surrounded by piles of discarded rusty steel parts, and even dilapidated, abandoned houses. In the center, there are many gas tanks that appear to have been unused for a long time."],["","Michaela projects several landmine detectors. These spherical objects are equipped with multiple suction cups and sensors on their surfaces, applying pressure to the ground as they roll. If a landmine is buried underground, it will instantly trigger an explosion."],["","The landmine detectors diligently roll through the pit as Michaela leads her subordinates slowly into the pit."],["Michaela","Everyone be careful, and be ready to engage as soon as the detector reacts!"],["Michaela Mercenary","Understood, boss. We've been keeping an eye on heat sources and mech signals, so don't worry."],["","The detector carefully scanned the entire landing area of the mine and soon rolled to the edge of the exit, safe all the way."],["Michaela","Looks like we overestimated them. There's indeed no ambush here. Let's go, let's hurry and chase!"],["","Michaela charged forward ahead of everyone."],["Michaela Mercenary","W-wait a minute, boss! Something's up! Multiple heat signatures just appeared—ah!!!"],["","Blinding firelight burst out from beneath the haphazardly stacked rusted steel plates. A rain of missiles slammed down into the pit, crashing into the ST units that hadn't made it out in time and setting off a chain of deafening explosions."],["Michaela","Damn things! They're hiding in that scrap metal!"],["Michaela","Fire all missiles! Force those guys out!"],["","Michaela's crew swiftly operated, locking onto non-friendly heat signals around them and launched rockets. Deafening eruptions blasted away surrounding rusty steel parts, dust billowed, and a massive shadow swiftly moved through it."],["Michaela","Well, now they can't hold back, can they? Everyone, prepare to engage!"],["???","You finally made it, Michaela. I didn't expect you to be so cautious. It seems the rumors that say you're all brawn and no brains might not be entirely true."],["","As the smoke clears, the exit of the mine is occupied by a squad of STs. Michaela wonders, as these guys' ST designs seem somewhat unfamiliar."],["Michaela","You're not from the Wild Thorns?!"],["???","Heh heh, that's not important. What's important is that, today, you're staying put. Not a step further."],["Michaela","Ha! So that's it, you're the surprise they left behind for me..."],["Michaela","But just you and your subordinates? You're underestimating me! Come on! Remember this battle well, let me become your nightmare!"]],"468321301":[["Michaela","Don't make any rash moves, kid. Your cockpit's in my crosshairs—one burst and you're going straight to hell!"],["","Even with the smoke from the artillery still hanging in the air, the situation is as clear for all to see. The Dopplesoldner in front of Mithril has lost both arms, leaving it with no ability to resist, and its subordinates have been disarmed and subdued on the ground."],["","This is undoubtedly a great victory for Michaela."],["Michaela","Open your cockpit door and come out with your hands on your head. Don't try anything funny."],["???","Uh, how's this sound? I just took the job from the Wild Thorns to help them escape, not to deliberately go against you. The mission was a success, so let us go, and when we get the remaining reward, we'll split it with you 50-50."],["Michaela","Haha! \"The mission was a success\"? You're jumping to conclusions."],["???","How is that possible? Even if you set out right now—no, it can't be, can it? Did you already send someone after them?"],["","Just as she finishes speaking, Michaela receives a new message."],["Gutzman","Did you really run into trouble in the mining area?"],["Michaela","What trouble? Just some rocks blocking the way, I'll move them aside. How's it going on your end?"],["Gutzman","The encirclement was successful. How d'ya want to handle it? By the sound of their foul mouths, they're still up for a fight."],["Michaela","Nicely done, I'll give you a coordinate, and we'll meet up there!"],["Michaela","...The negotiations with the Wild Thorns didn't go well. They set up hidden mines at the negotiation site and caught me off guard, injuring quite a few of my men."],["Michaela","But rest assured, I've taken care of everything that needed handling, and it won't affect your upcoming action plans, boss."],["","On the empty rooftop, Michaela was reporting today's battle situation to someone on a secure channel."],["","She gazed at the night sky for a long time before hearing the response, the voice sounded listless and incredibly tired."],["","Alright, thank you for your hard work, Michaela."],["","Still, next time we should try to avoid clashes this intense. Our goal is to unify the mercenary factions—not to draw all their hatred and spark unnecessary conflicts."],["Michaela","......"],["","Michaela scratched her head, feeling a bit awkward."],["","Inciting conflicts was her forte. Negotiation, not so much."],["","Why bother with lengthy discussions when you can use force to cut through the chaos? If someone doesn't comply, then beat them into submission—this is one of her life mottos. But if the boss has already requested this..."],["Michaela","Alright, boss, I've been keeping an eye on things. The new consultant we found recently is quite eloquent, probably can be of some use."],["","......"],["Michaela","......"],["Michaela","...Boss? Are you still there?"],["","Ah, sorry, I went to handle a system error—just in time, I need to synchronize something with you, Michaela."],["","There's been some minor unrest in the military recently. I'm assisting other departments in launching a very important investigation. Unfortunately, it's already at a critical stage, and I'm a bit overwhelmed, so..."],["Michaela","I understand, you don't need to worry about the tasks, Boss. I'll make sure everything is taken care of."],["","Alright, thank you for your hard work, Michaela. Looking forward to your good news."],["Michaela","Hey, hey! Don't hang up, boss! I have one more urgent matter!"],["","What happened?"],["Michaela","Almost forgot to mention it—I caught a mercenary today. The arm gauntlets he was using looked like the same Harpy batch as ours."],["Michaela","Didn't the NDF already buy out that batch of goods? How is it circulating among mercs...? I want to know if you sent another team to participate in this mission, boss?"],["","...No, this mission was specially approved by the madam, and the executors only include you and your subordinates."],["Michaela","So... could it be that another force has infiltrated UNCS territory? Do you need me to continue with a follow-up report?"],["","There was a moment of silence on the other end of the communicator, but Michaela heard the sound of a keyboard being tapped continuously."],["","I see... He actually... Ha. All this time I thought he moved his assets abroad. He's really gone about this carefully this time."],["Michaela","What are you talking about, boss?"],["","Nothing, Michaela. First, send back that guy's arm guard for me to take a look."],["Michaela","Huh?"],["","Put the current mission on hold—there's an urgent order that has to take priority."],["","In Michaela's temporary base, Gutzman is reclining in a chair, looking quite relaxed, with a half-drunk beer by his side."],["???","I didn't expect to see you here, Gutzman. That recent civil war among your Iguanas has been the talk of the town."],["Gutzman","I'm also surprised to see you, Pip. The last time we met was... haha, I can't remember, it must have been several years ago, right?"],["Gutzman","Back then you were living like a real high-roller. You had some real swagger—throwing money like it grew on trees."],["","Pip was embarrassed. As Gutzman spoke, he sat comfortably, slouching back in his chair; meanwhile, Pip sat tied up with his backside on the cold floor!"],["Pip","Hey, don't mock me, Gutzman. I just got caught this time. Isn't this a regular occurrence in our line of work? Just let me go, and I'll be living the high life again in no time..."],["Gutzman","Really? And what's in it for me?"],["Pip","Easy, easy. If you let me go, I'll split my reward 50-50—"],["","Pip hesitated for a moment."],["","This outpost had zero soundproofing. He'd caught every single bit of the Wild Thorn boss's agonizing meltdown next door, listening to him curse out absolutely everyone—from Michaela at the top right down to Pip."],["","At this point, the mission was a complete failure. Now he was only left with the initial deposit, would Gutzman even care about such a small amount?"],["","Seeing Pip's awkward smile, Gutzman didn't continue to make things difficult for him. After taking a sip of beer, he let out a long sigh, feeling quite resigned."],["Gutzman","Are you still working solo now?"],["Pip","Well... not really. I've joined a new team and occasionally help them out, but I still have quite a bit of free time."],["Gutzman","A... new team?"],["","Gutzman gave a knowing look."],["Gutzman","What's the name? Getting funding from Harpy?"],["Pip","Skyrend, Skyrend Mercenary Group. I'm not sure if it's funded by Harpy. Our boss is very low-key, and I'm just a newcomer now, so they wouldn't tell me everything, y'know?"],["Gutzman","......"],["","Gutzman looked at Pip without speaking."],["Pip","Well, I do have my suspicions. Maybe they're backing us from behind the scenes. You saw those armguards, right? After I joined and did a few good jobs, the boss gave me a pair."],["Pip","I tried it out and found it to be incredible. Isn't this the Regeneration Armguard that was all the rage before?"],["Pip","Harpy once issued a bounty for that kind of armguard... Haha, you should know this better than anyone. So yeah, I figure Harpy might be our major shareholder."],["Pip","Hmm, speaking of which, doesn't your current boss also have this kind of gear? So are you guys...?"],["","Pip's voice gradually trailed off because he noticed Gutzman had already looked away, somewhat absent-minded, clearly not wanting to continue the topic."],["","He instantly changed tack."],["Pip","How about we make a deal, Gutzman? Is there really any need for conflict between us?"],["Pip","Think about it, your goal was to catch the Wild Thorns and teach them a lesson—hasn't that been accomplished now? There's really no need to focus on a roadblock like me, just kick me aside, right?"],["Pip","Trust me, I have absolutely no intention of getting involved in the feud between you and the Wild Thorns, nor do I have any plans for vengeance. Just let me go, and next time you need my help, I'll waive the fee, how about that?"],["","Pip said earnestly, believing he had used a sincerity and warmth he had never shown in his life."],["Pip","If you're worried that Michaela will come after you once you let me go... it's okay, I've already thought it through."],["Pip","You can pretend to be held hostage by me, and once we leave this base and reach a safe place, we'll part ways. This way, you can clear yourself completely and even get a free pass afterwards—"],["Pip","That's a free pass! Such good deals don't come often in Milkhama! Only a fool wouldn't take advantage!"],["Gutzman","Hahaha..."],["","Gutzman was amused. He shifted in his seat, shaking his head."],["Gutzman","The conditions you described are somewhat enticing, but unfortunately for you, Pip, they're not quite enough to sway me."],["Pip","Ah... the human heart is never satisfied, so... I guess I'll just have to..."],["","Gutzman keenly sensed something, he braced against the table, where he had a handgun prepared earlier."],["","Pip gradually lowered his head."],["Pip","Then I'll just have to wait for death. Ah! Could I at least have a gentle lady to kill me when the time comes? As a dying wish, some end-of-life care shouldn't be too much to ask..."],["Gutzman","......"],["","Gutzman relaxed, it seemed he was just being overly nervous."],["Gutzman","Quit dreaming. You'd have better luck praying there's enough left of you to bury."],["","Gutzman said it casually—then a rapid series of thudding booms burst into his ears, fast and pounding like a war drum."],["","His whole body tensed, and he instinctively turned his head to look. In just a breath, Pip's figure had already enveloped him!"],["Pip","Haha, tricked ya!"],["","Pip spoke with a grin, but a flash of cold sharpness crossed his eyes as his raised fist came crashing down like a hammer."],["","Bang!"],["","The door was suddenly slammed open."],["Michaela","I have some good news..."],["","Michaela's voice, filled with laughter, abruptly stops. In front of her, the person who should have been securely tied up is now grabbing her subordinate by the collar, with a raised fist just inches away from knocking out her subordinate's teeth."],["","But she doesn't need to worry too much, as her subordinate's gun is already pressed against the attacker's chin."],["Gutzman","......"],["Pip","......"],["","Pip opens his mouth but can't utter a single word."],["Pip","Uh, haha..."],["","He spread his arms, feeling very awkward, yet still managed to force a smile as he adjusted Gutzman's collar and jumped off the table."],["","While showing his empty hands, he moved with a hyperactive demeanor, as if covered in spikes, to the corner to pick up the rope that had originally bound him, examining it with great interest."],["Pip","Oh dear, the quality of this rope is truly disappointing. How could it break so easily? Rope manufacturers these days, huh? How do we tie it back together? Like this? And then like this?"],["Michaela","You..."],["Pip","I surrender! Don't shoot!!"],["","Pip raised his two-handed high, eagerly pledging his loyalty."],["Michaela","......"],["","Michaela raised an eyebrow and strode over to pat Pip on the shoulder."],["Michaela","Not bad, kid."],["Pip","...Huh? Is this some kind of new end-of-life care?"],["Michaela","I tied you up myself and double-checked that you had no firearms or knives, yet you still managed to free yourself?"],["Pip","Well... when you're out and about, you need some skills to rely on... but I promise I'm completely out of tricks now! I'm no threat, please rest assured!"],["Michaela","Good kid, I admire your improvisation skills. Consider teaming up with me?"],["Pip","...Huh?"],["Pip","Huh???"],["Pip","C-could you say that again?"],["Pip","—Ah, I'm not questioning you, don't get me wrong. I'm just... surprised."],["Pip","You did ask me if I wanted to..."],["Michaela","\"Join you\"—you heard right. Now quit the chatter."],["","Pip shrugged and immediately beamed."],["Pip","Of course, I'd love to! I've been an admirer of yours for years! To think I'd get a direct invitation from the great Michaela herself... I'll include this moment in my \"Annual Highlight Reel\"!"],["Gutzman","You should think it over, Pip. Hastily agreeing will only cause trouble for everyone."],["","Michaela turned to look at Gutzman, pointing at Pip with a puzzled expression."],["Michaela","What trouble? Isn't this kid working solo?"],["","Gutzman rubbed his forehead, unsure what idea his new boss had come up with this time."],["Gutzman","Of course not. He's a rookie from Skyrend—and Skyrend isn't a merc group with deep roots. They were founded only recently."],["Pip","Ah, but they're a great group! See? Pip never badmouths a former employer!"],["Gutzman","\"Former employer\"? Ha, you changed your tune quickly."],["Gutzman","But—Michaela, are we really prepared to shield Pip from every pursuer Skyrend sends?"],["Michaela","......"],["","Michaela crossed her arms and fell into thought, her eyes constantly sizing up Pip."],["Gutzman","Moreover, can the promises he makes in his current situation be trusted? He might just be pretending to join us until he can make a break for it later. It's not impossible."],["Michaela","Hmm..."],["Pip","Uh, Boss Michaela, I believe you're sincerely inviting me to join your team, and of course, I'm eager to realize my value in a strong enough team. Maybe we can give each other a new chance."],["Pip","Everyone has a past they'd rather forget. We should focus on the bright future instead of dwelling on the dark past..."],["Michaela","Good point."],["","Pip grinned—then realized Michaela was speaking to Gutzman."],["Pip","......"],["Michaela","Maybe it's not just you I admire, Pip, but also your 'strong enough team,' haha!"],["","Michaela clapped Pip's shoulder twice forcefully, and Pip immediately felt his entire arm go numb."],["Michaela","So you can go back and tell your boss—yes, don't be so surprised, I have indeed decided to let you go now, but your ST has to stay."],["Michaela","Go back and tell your boss that Michaela has a big deal she wants to cut him in on!"],["Pip","A... a job?"],["Michaela","Ha, becoming the 'Mercenary King of Milkhama'—is that big enough?"]],"468325101":[["","The rooftop. Gutzman nurses a bottle of beer, taking a sip now and then. He stares out at the distant starry sky, where the galaxy seems to spill over the horizon."],["","In his memory, he has seen such a night sky before, back when he was the second-in-command of the Iguanas. On cold late nights, if the Iguanas camped outdoors, they would sit around the campfire to keep warm, with this kind of starry sky overhead."],["","Georgia sleeps little and is usually the first to keep watch. Sometimes, if Gutzman can't sleep, he would bring his drink over to chat with her for a bit."],["Gutzman","......"],["","With a dazed expression, he reflexively lifts the bottle to his mouth, taking a sip without thinking."],["???","You mad about something?"],["","With a bang, Gutzman was jolted awake from his memory."],["","Suddenly, a 12-pack of beer appeared beside him. Michaela gave the box a pat, as if to say \"plenty to go around.\""],["Michaela","Come on, drinking alone late at night is boring as hell. I'll join you."],["Gutzman","......"],["","Gutzman silently continued to gulp down one mouthful after another."],["Michaela","Really? Are you mad at me just because I let that kid go?"],["Gutzman","Not at all. You're the boss. It's only right for you to weigh things your own way."],["Michaela","Then why the long face?"],["Michaela","Oh, I get it. It's nighttime, and emotions are running high, right?"],["Gutzman","......"],["Michaela","Sigh."],["","Michaela cracked open a bottle. She took a big gulp, then let out a mighty beer burp, looking very pleased with herself."],["Michaela","Ah—that hits the spot! A cold beer after a victory—bliss!"],["","Gutzman glanced at her, turned slightly, and clinked her bottle, producing a short, crisp sound."],["","The two of them finished a bottle."],["Gutzman","I checked on the web. Skyrend haven't even been registered for half a year..."],["Michaela","Hahaha... See, you're still upset about this."],["Gutzman","I'm not upset, I just think that knowing yourself and knowing your enemy is the best way to handle potential future dangers."],["Michaela","Alright, go on."],["Gutzman","Pip didn't lie to me, the mercenary group he recently joined is indeed young."],["Gutzman","Do you know how we veterans view those mercenary groups that haven't been registered for long but have ample funds and equipment support?"],["Michaela","Isn't it just having a powerful backer?"],["Gutzman","Maybe you should try reversing the cause and effect—not a mercenary group first and then a backer, but a backer first and then a mercenary group."],["Michaela","What's the difference?"],["Gutzman","The big shots need to achieve some unspeakable goals, and they don't want to dirty their own hands or be discovered, so they outsource the dirty work to keep themselves out of the picture."],["Gutzman","But they don't trust others, so they have to form a reliable team themselves. You'll find that on the island, there are often newcomers flaunting high-end limited edition STs in front of you, but without the support of those big shots, they'd be nothing."],["Gutzman","Skyrend... Heh, it's probably just wearing the guise of a mercenary group, but the tasks it undertakes are beyond our imagination."],["Michaela","...Gutzman, I'm really glad I picked you up as an advisor."],["Gutzman","Like I keep saying, I wasn't picked by you. We had a fair fight, I won, you lost, and we're in a partnership."],["Michaela","Alright, alright, alright... anyway, your speculation does make sense."],["","Michaela also gazes into the distance like Gutzman, but her eyes subtly flicker, hinting at some thoughts crossing her mind."],["Gutzman","If you want to lead the mercenary forces in West Milkhama, you can't avoid dealing with Skyrend. But we still have a choice on when to take action against it."],["Gutzman","We are still unclear about the forces behind that team. Recklessly engaging with them might bring a lot of trouble, even if you have Harpy—"],["Michaela","Don't be a coward, okay Gutzman? You really don't seem like the old you right now."],["Michaela","Although I didn't know you that well before, a man who could decisively break away from Georgia and establish his own faction, and single-handedly turn the mercenary market upside down—that kind of man's no coward."],["","Gutzman smiled and shook his head, slowly taking out a pack of cigarettes. He went to light up, but Michaela glared—his new boss hated secondhand smoke."],["Gutzman","Haven't you heard those rumors? Actually, Georgia and I didn't part ways peacefully. I betrayed her. Would've killed her if I had the chance."],["Michaela","Kill Georgia? You sure had guts back then."],["Gutzman","Heh... Aren't you afraid I might betray you in the future and try to kill you too?"],["Michaela","Ha! I'm not like Georgia, Gutzman. I'm even harder to kill. You better use all your strength to kill me, or else—"],["Michaela","Tsk, that would be too boring."],["Gutzman","...Hey, you really are—"],["","Gutzman is at a loss for words, sometimes he really wants to pry open her head to see if it's all water inside."],["Michaela","Come on, Gutzman, don't dwell on the last failure—I'm not taking sides with you or Georgia, nor am I trying to comfort you, this is just a reminder—"],["Michaela","This world, this battlefield remains vast, and being doggedly stuck in the past will only make you miss more of the highlight reel."],["Gutzman","..."],["Gutzman","Harpy."],["","Gutzman took a few big gulps and abruptly changed the subject."],["Gutzman","Since both you and Skyrend are connected to Harpy, why not ask Harpy about Skyrend's background?"],["Michaela","Hahaha... Hey, Gutzman, just because we both used regeneration arm parts, you think we're both funded by Harpy?"],["","Gutzman's hand paused while holding the bottle, then slowly put it down."],["Gutzman","Sounds like you have other suspicions?"],["Michaela","......"],["","Michaela also put down the bottle, sighing and pulling her hair, feeling a bit agitated."],["Michaela","This goes way back. What do you think Harpy brought in that batch of goods for? Of course, it's to make money, brother! They won't just let that batch rust in the depot, they're definitely going to sell it."],["Michaela","Last time, you gave them a great advertisement, and now everyone knows how useful these parts are."],["Michaela","This has led to too many people wanting them, driving the price of those parts to a level that most people can't afford."],["","As she spoke, she doubled over, bottle still in hand. She felt a little lightheaded—the alcohol had started to hit her."],["Gutzman","Have you heard any rumors?"],["Michaela","Heh... Well, well... Who do you think would go to such great lengths to prepare those \"war machines\" now?"],["Gutzman","......"],["Michaela","Of course... It's the ones who are going to war!"],["Gutzman","…The military?"],["","Gutzman's heart skipped a beat. Indeed, this was a direction he hadn't considered..."],["Gutzman","If Skyrend is from the military, I think we should avoid getting too involved with them for now."],["Michaela","Tsk... Who told you... Skyrend..."],["Gutzman","They have their own missions, and we have our own goals. It's best if we stay out of each other's way."],["Michaela","What you even... afraid of... I... ugh..."],["Gutzman","Michaela?"],["","Gutzman glanced sideways, unsurprised to see his current boss snoring away with a bottle in hand."],["Gutzman","Well..."],["","Gutzman took a few sips of his drink, feeling a bit frustrated as the thought that had appeared most frequently over the past month surged in his mind."],["","—Why did he choose to join this team?"],["","One month ago"],["Gutzman Mercenary","Boss! You're finally awake!"],["","Gutzman slowly opens his eyes, his brain still lingering with the pain from the violent impact."],["Gutzman","W-What the... what's going on?"],["Gutzman Mercenary","When we received the signal and arrived, you had already passed out, so we had to bring you to a safe place and wait for you to wake up before making any plans."],["Gutzman Mercenary","We're now at the bottom of a ravine. We've concealed the entrance we used to come down, so the Iguanas shouldn't notice it."],["","Gutzman shook his head, trying to shake off the chaotic thoughts in his mind."],["","He tried to recall what happened. After shaking off Georgia, he activated the Hades' autopilot mode and headed in another direction himself."],["","This way, the Iguanas should be drawn onto the wrong path in pursuit of the Hades, allowing him to escape smoothly. Unfortunately, he lost consciousness halfway due to exhaustion, but fortunately, he remembered to send the location signal at the last moment."],["Gutzman","How long was I unconscious?"],["Gutzman Mercenary","About a day or so."],["Gutzman","......"],["","Gutzman slowly stood up from the ground."],["Gutzman","We need to... get outta here fast. How many are left?"],["Gutzman Mercenary","...Everyone's here."],["","Gutzman glanced around and silently counted seven figures."],["Gutzman","As long as we're alive, there's a chance to rise again."],["Gutzman","The priority is to leave here and return to..."],["","The base?"],["","Gutzman's head started hurting again. With Georgia's way of doing things, if she hasn't found him yet, she won't be circling around here. His base has probably been cleaned out by now."],["Gutzman","The priority... is to find help."],["Gutzman Mercenary","Mr. Henry?"],["Gutzman","......"],["","Gutzman was silent for a moment and shook his head."],["Gutzman","Leave here first. How's your ST doing?"],["Gutzman Mercenary","Don't worry, boss. The brothers have sufficient ammo for now."],["Gutzman Mercenary","We've brought Gillesrais along too, so we can move faster."],["","The group boarded the ST and began to move forward. There are no man-made roads here, so they can only use the ST to clear a path through the forest. Even so, it's much faster than walking on foot."],["Gutzman Mercenary","If we continue at this speed, we'll reach the open area in about ten minutes. That's the place where we're most likely to encounter an ambush, so please stay alert."],["","Gutzman expanded the working range of the thermal sensor, and several red dots suddenly appeared on the display."],["Gutzman","What?"],["","Everyone became tense, surrounding Gutzman with their guns pointed outward."],["Gutzman Mercenary","Hold on, I'll go check."],["","He controlled the ST and had just taken a few steps forward when varying mechanical sounds and dense footsteps emerged from the forest, and a swarm of quadrupedal mechanical beasts appeared from the woods."],["","They seemed to have no aggression, just like a startled swarm of insects."],["Recruit","What the—?! Where did these things come from?"],["","The tall STs stood their ground, looking somewhat helplessly at the little things scurrying around at their feet."],["","Some of them would collide with the STs, then take a few steps back and turn around, while others would shatter like ice upon impact, quickly dissipating into the air."],["","Gutzman and his subordinates, of course, saw the whole strange scene unfold."],["Gutzman Mercenary","What... exactly are these things?"],["Recruit","They're like holograms..."],["Gutzman","Check if your sensors are experiencing any malfunctions."],["Gutzman Mercenary","Y-Yes! The controllers are acting up! What's going on?!"],["Gutzman","There seems to be a high concentration of arashi matter here... We might have either accidentally discovered a new source of arashi ore, or we've stumbled into someone else's experimental factory."],["Recruit","Seriously, boss? That's awesome! If we claim this new arashi deposit for ourselves, won't that make us untouchable on Milkhama Island?"],["Gutzman","Don't get too excited too soon. This is just an unfounded guess. Besides, this is within West Milkhama territory. Even if it is arashi ore, if the military is guarding it, charging in would be a dead end for us."],["Recruit","Huh? No way... I thought we were about to make a fortune!"],["Gutzman","At this stage, it's best not to get into any conflicts with anyone... Don't move forward any further. Replan the route, and let's head in a different direction."],["","As dawn breaks, they realize they've been walking in this forest all night."],["Gutzman Mercenary","Boss... Why do I feel like something's off?"],["Recruit","Y-yeah, Boss! Even if we took a detour, we shouldn't have been walking all night without getting out of this forest, right?"],["Recruit","We were just ten minutes away from getting out at the start!"],["","Gutzman didn't say a word. He adjusted the navigation system and finally had to face a fact—"],["Gutzman","Damn... Our navigation system has been affected by that arashi matter. No matter how we set it, it always leads us to the same place!"],["","As if to prove his conclusion, those quadrupedal mechanical beasts emerged from behind them. These little things have been following them... No, all of them are being brought here by an invisible force."],["Recruit","Quick, quick look! Up ahead! We can get out up ahead!"],["","The group slowly moved forward in their STs. Ahead was a steep slope leading to a vast, rocky open area. They finally reached the intended open space, but a group of other STs had gathered there, uncertain whether they were friend or foe."],["Recruit","What are they doing? Judging by the style of their STs, they don't seem to be from the military."],["","In the distance, an ST suddenly started moving. Inside the cockpits of Gutzman's STs, all screens displayed varying degrees of chaos, indicating that their STs had just suffered significant radiation Impact."],["Recruit","B-Boss! Shouldn't we be leaving? I don't like this one bit..."],["Gutzman","Quiet! Wait a little longer!"],["","Gutzman feels an eerie premonition as he intently watches the images relayed by the detector. The ST begins to emit a shimmering glow, outlining its entire form like a new layer of armor."],["","It moved again—it took a step forward, and the light on its body instantly vanished, left behind in its wake. The light gradually dimmed, but the \"armor\" did not disappear... \"It\" became a \"new\" ST!"],["","Gutzman watched nervously and with euphoria, suddenly realizing. It's \"Mirror Image\"! These guys must be using arashi material to prepare for something big! That's how the holograms of those quadrupedal mechanical beasts were created!"],["Gutzman Mercenary","Boss, we really should leave. If they find out we're watching, there will definitely be trouble!"],["???","It's amazing someone actually came here—"],["","A strange voice suddenly joined their communication channel, startling everyone. Have we been discovered?!"],["Gutzman Mercenary","Look! It's those mechanical beasts! They've been running down, exposing our position!"],["???","Today is my lucky day! On the first day of the experiment, a guinea pig comes to let me test its power! Come out quickly! If I have enough fun beating you, I might spare your lives!"],["Gutzman Mercenary","Boss!"],["Gutzman","Let's go down."],["","Gutzman's voice trembled slightly, and his palms began to sweat, yet his grip on the control stick remained rock-solid."],["","He knew this might be a brand new opportunity—one he must seize with absolute precision."]],"468325301":[["","Bzz—bzzzz—"],["","Mithril's body sparks all over, and it uses its last energy to step back a few paces, immediately having ST soldiers rush up to shield it from behind."],["Michaela","Tsk, this research still isn't perfected, but at least I've gathered some good practical data to report back."],["Gutzman","I remember your voice. You're Michaela, right?"],["Michaela","Your voice sounds familiar too. Who was it again? That guy everyone's been talking about lately, used to hang out with Georgia... Ohh, what was his name...?"],["Gutzman","...Gutzman."],["Michaela","Gutzman! Is that really you? What brings you here? After collecting millions in bounty, you've taken a liking to... uh, spring outings or something?"],["","Gutzman was momentarily at a loss for words. He wasn't well-acquainted with Michaela, so he hadn't truly experienced her unique personality."],["","But that's exactly what he needed. If Michaela were as shrewd as Georgia, today might not have ended well."],["Gutzman","That's what I want to ask you, Michaela. What are you doing here? And what are those \"Holograms\" all about?"],["Michaela","Ha! No comment, Gutzman."],["Michaela","I admit, you and your seven subordinates—you guys have some skill to beat me up like this, but that doesn't mean I have to tell you everything that happened here."],["Gutzman","Heh, is that so? Then..."],["","Gillesrais was just about to raise his gun when, in the next second, a long-range shot hit his arm."],["Gutzman Mercenary","More enemy troops?!"],["Michaela","Hahaha! Did you really think I'd be out here with so few people?"],["","The ground rumbles as more and more STs converge from all directions. Mithril takes two steps forward, and the ST in front of it naturally moves to its side."],["Michaela","Tsk, although your timing is perfect, it wouldn't be fair to attack them now."],["Michaela Mercenary","So what do you say, boss? Should we detain them first and then challenge them one-on-one later?"],["Michaela","Hmm..."],["Michaela Mercenary","Today's experiment was supposed to be conducted in secret as instructed by the boss, but these guys barged in... It would be hard to explain to the higher-ups later, right, boss?"],["Michaela","Indeed, maybe we should just kill them first—"],["Gutzman","We've met before, Michaela."],["","The scene has been silent for a long time. Gutzman doesn't know what Michaela and her subordinates discussed, but it must be about how to handle the current situation."],["","He didn't charge down with a determination to die. Moreover, being able to seize the opportunity of Michaela's mistake and defeat her once is a pleasant surprise. He intends to firmly grasp this opportunity."],["Gutzman","Back then, you hadn't formed a team yet, because you always took on the toughest and most dangerous missions, and few dared to charge into battle with you."],["Gutzman","At that time, you said that one day, everyone in Milkhama would recognize your emblem—"],["Gutzman","If this is still your dream... I want to lend you a helping hand."],["","The night is as cool as water."],["","Michaela has already fallen asleep, and Gutzman is no longer gulping down alcohol, only sipping occasionally. As the alcohol ferments in the brain, memories of the past, both significant and trivial, begin to swell."],["","He still remembers later, the look of astonishment on the face of the one sleeping soundly at his feet when she learned that he had lost almost his entire fortune to Georgia."],["","However, her focus was surprisingly on how he \"lost to Georgia,\" rather than the fact that his current savings might not be of much use."],["","All the explanations he had prepared went unused because this one hadn't even thought that far ahead."],["","Amidst his joy, he also felt a tinge of worry, concerned that his consulting career might have hit a brick wall."],["Gutzman","Impulsive, arrogant, outspoken... and a transparent mind that reveals thoughts at a glance. How have you managed to survive on Milkhama until now?"],["Michaela","......zzzzzz"],["Gutzman","Sigh."],["","Gutzman put down the empty bottle and found a sheltered corner to comfortably lie down."],["","There's nothing left to agonize over—no \"normal person\" can survive on this island anyway. Instead of digging into her background, we might as well look forward to the \"surprise.\""],["","He closed his eyes, and the \"Radiant Armor\" once again flickered in his mind. In the darkness, it was like the only beacon, guiding all lost travelers towards the beyond."],["","Now, just wait for the right moment."],["","..."],["","Wait for the right moment?"],["","Gutzman suddenly realized that a bit of doubt had arisen in his heart. Michaela accepted him so easily, is there a conspiracy he hasn't yet realized?"],["","…Although based on his understanding of Michaela over the time, this suspicion might not be likely, but what if? What if there's something crucial that he missed?"],["","Just like Georgia secretly arranged an insider in the desert, only to stab him hard when he was most proud and successful."],["","If he had considered more carefully at that time, if he had not chosen to let Georgia go, things might have turned out differently..."],["Michaela","You bastard! Stop right there!"],["","Michaela blurted out a line in her sleep, then quickly drifted back to sleep."],["","Gutzman turned to the side, thoughtfully watching Michaela sleep peacefully."],["","Was his choice right this time?"]],"468329101":[["","...Defeated?!"],["","I gave you every kind of support imaginable! Resources, manpower, equipment, money—you name it! With backing like that, any ragtag band of mercs could make a name for themselves, and yet you still managed to botch a run-of-the-mill support mission!"],["White Flame","......"],["","White Flame rubbed her brow with some fatigue."],["White Flame","It was my oversight, boss. Michaela's been on a strong streak lately, but I believed that with our equipment advantage, the odds were still in our favor..."],["","I don't have time to listen to you recap how those foolish decisions were made. I just need you to ensure that next time I don't receive news of your failure after a busy day, got it?"],["White Flame","...Understood, boss."],["","From the other end of the receiver came the distinctive sound of a leather chair sinking, and White Flame also heard a frustrated sigh."],["","Don't resent me; I'm doing this for everyone."],["","White Flame raised an eyebrow."],["White Flame","Yes, we all understand."],["","Nightingale... heh, now it's called \"Skyrend.\" We took such a big risk, reallocating military supplies to rearm it inside and out, so we must create benefits far exceeding those risks..."],["","Don't forget our agreement... White Flame, the hope for your family's revival is in your hands."],["","A flicker of disgust flashed in White Flame's eyes."],["White Flame","I understand, boss. We will be more cautious moving forward."],["","That's your business, I only want results."],["","*beep* The call was disconnected."],["","White Flame closed her eyes briefly, with a few barely noticeable fine lines on her brow."],["","She always kept her emotions in check, only those familiar with her could sense her slight irritation at this moment—dealing with such a superior is no easy task."],["","She took a deep breath and then called Pip in."],["","The usually carefree hip-hop youth walked in with a firm, righteous stride."],["Pip","Whatever your orders are, I'll carry them out. There's no need to be angry, boss."],["White Flame","If I could undo the losses we took by getting angry, do you think you'd still be breathing?"],["Pip","Of course not, boss, I know you always care for your subordinates, and considering how excellent my apology's been..."],["","White Flame silently picked up her sidearm."],["Pip","Uh, and the important strategic information I brought back! Surely, you have already made a fair and reasonable judgment in your heart."],["","White Flame smiled, gave Pip a meaningful glance, and then slowly began to clean her gun."],["White Flame","Think I should accept her offer?"],["Pip","I'd never presume to say you \"should\" do anything, boss. I just feel like we don't have much reason to turn her down."],["Pip","Whose money isn't worth earning, boss? Besides, Michaela has quite an appetite, and when she makes a move, it's a big one. We can slightly raise the price and quickly make up for the losses in the team, don't you think?"],["","White Flame remained silent. Unlike Pip's optimism, she had her own concerns."],["","In fact, Skyrend isn't really suited to get too involved with other mercenary forces. Its predecessor was the Nightingale Task Force, backed by the NDF. The fewer people who know this secret, the safer their team is."],["","But given the current situation... White Flame paused her gun cleaning."],["White Flame","Contact Michaela and arrange a time to talk—remember, just to talk."],["Pip","I'm on it!"],["Michaela","Ugh, deserts!"],["","Michaela impatiently shakes the fine sand out of her hair."],["","They set up a makeshift artificial canopy here, and everyone casually sits on the ground to rest. Michaela just woke up from a nap, inevitably getting sand on the back of her head."],["Michaela","If you get injured in a place like this, it's hard to clean all the sand out of the wound once it mixes with blood. If you're not careful, it can end you."],["Gutzman","Sounds like you're experienced."],["Michaela","If you haven't had this experience, it means you're not fit for this consultant role. Improve your professional competitiveness before I fire you."],["Gutzman","Heh... I did warn you to change locations."],["","Gutzman raised his binoculars and looked into the distance. Gradually, a team of STs appeared in his view."],["Michaela","Tsk... You don't get it. I was referring to the enemy."],["Gutzman","They're here, let's prepare."],["Michaela","......"],["","Michaela didn't respond, and when Gutzman looked down, he found his boss scratching her head and studying a terminal filled with text."],["Gutzman","...And this is?"],["Michaela","Records of some situations with Skyrend."],["","Gutzman was somewhat caught off guard—Michaela actually conducted a pre-negotiation offensive. But since she cares so much about the outcome of the negotiation, why did she ignore the drafting of the cooperation agreement last night?"],["","He didn't ask. Skyrend's team was getting closer, and the underlings quickly scrambled to tidy up the scene. By the time they finished, Skyrend's ST team had just stopped in front of them."],["","The pilot hatch of the leading mass production Wolverine opens first, and White Flame slowly descends the rope ladder."],["","White Flame quickly scanned the entire area. Michaela's team was very concentrated, perhaps to show their friendliness, everyone stood only under their own ST."],["","White Flame quickly tapped twice on the communicator at his waist, and soon the members of Skyrend lowered the rope ladders."],["Michaela","The leader of Skyrend, huh? Cool mask."],["","Michaela reached out to White Flame."],["Michaela","Michaela. Pip should've already introduced me to you."],["White Flame","White Flame."],["","White Flame reached out, and they quickly shook hands."],["White Flame","I'm quite interested in your proposal. How about we rack up the details?"],["Michaela","Of course."],["","The group removed their firearms and walked into the shade of the canopy. Michaela nodded at Gutzman, signaling for him to step forward, clearly intending to delegate the areas she's not proficient in."],["","Gutzman, already accustomed to her demeanor, cleared his throat and prepared to slowly present the agreement drafted last night."],["Gutzman","Pleasure to meet you, White Flame. I'm Gutzman. I'll introduce the details of the job. If you have any questions, feel free."],["White Flame","Hmm, go ahead."],["Gutzman","First, let's address the commission distribution ratio that everyone is concerned about. We hope that, upon successful completion of the mission, the commission should be distributed based on the ratio of the number of members in our two teams—"],["White Flame","I agree with this distribution principle, provided that individual capabilities are equal."],["","Gutzman paused, surprised that they couldn't agree on the first point. But fortunately, he was already prepared."],["Gutzman","But—"],["White Flame","I think it's best to allocate based on the number of people deployed by the two teams and the difficulty of the tasks they undertake. After all, the battlefield situation changes rapidly, and if we set the ratio in stone from the start, there's no guarantee that there won't be unfair distribution in the end."],["","Gutzman remained silent, looking at his boss. However, his boss wasn't very concerned about how their conversation was going, as her gaze never left Skyrend's STs."],["","Tch, this guy...!"],["White Flame","If you have no objections to my proposal, then we can continue our discussion..."],["Michaela","By the way—I didn't know you brought some gifts along."],["","Michaela suddenly changed the subject, leaving everyone present stunned, unsure of her intentions."],["","She pointed to several transport vehicles at the end of the Skyrend team's convoy, covered with thick waterproof tarps, making it impossible to see what was inside."],["Michaela","Sealed so tightly, it must be something to give away, right? Haha, it couldn't possibly be some kind of weapon of mass destruction?"],["White Flame","...Of course. If the deal goes through, we'll split the goods from those vehicles—it's all quality stuff from Harpy."],["Michaela","That's good."],["","Gutzman was about to continue speaking when his boss interrupted him once again."],["Michaela","Are you the one really calling the shots for Skyrend in these negotiations?"],["White Flame","...What do you mean? I'm the leader of Skyrend, of course I—"],["Michaela","Then I'm a bit curious—how did you manage to get that advanced equipment when you just started out?"],["White Flame","......"],["","Michaela asked directly, which seemed a bit sharp in the context of the first meeting between the leaders of two mercenary groups."],["White Flame","If you can't research my past on your own, don't expect me to answer that question, Michaela."],["Michaela","Haha, don't be upset, I'm just trying to make our conversation a bit more efficient."],["Michaela","Instead of waiting for you to discuss with the real boss after we're done talking, why not let us talk to him directly?"],["White Flame","Don't joke around. I've been the sole leader of Skyrend from the start."],["Michaela","You can't blame people for thinking that way. After all, ordinary folks rarely have the chance to access that kind of equipment. As far as I understand, the only way to open those channels is to get involved with certain people."],["Michaela","Besides GKD Parcel Service and Harpy, there's only—"],["","Michaela suddenly went silent, only mouthing the words. It was three characters, which White Flame easily recognized, letting out a chuckle from behind the mask."],["White Flame","Your imagination is rich, yet quite absurd."],["White Flame","I suspect your true purpose today is to explore my secrets under the guise of cooperation. A commendable yet dull attempt."],["","White Flame paused. For a moment, her peripheral vision detected a bright reflection from above, fleeting like the glare of a scope. Her dynamic vision is excellent, and that feeling was unmistakable."],["","In that direction stands Michaela's ST squad... above?"],["White Flame","!?"],["","White Flame's gaze turned cold as she tapped the communicator at her waist."],["White Flame","It seems you have no intention of cooperating, Michaela... Let's terminate the negotiations."],["Michaela","Calm down, White Flame, I'm not finished yet..."],["","White Flame turned around and walked away. Upon hearing Michaela's footsteps following her, she decisively kicked the iron rod supporting the canopy. The wide curtain quickly fell, covering Michaela and her group."],["Michaela","Damn it! She's trying to escape!"],["","No sooner had the words left her mouth than Michaela heard the deafening sound of rockets launching in rapid succession. Surprise flashed across her face—this was not part of the plan. Which could only mean..."],["Michaela","She really was up to something! Damn it, she got the jump on us!"],["","The STs in Michaela's team swiftly moved to raise their shields—they activated with exceptional speed because there was always someone on standby in the cockpit. White Flame only saw the person beneath the STs and assumed Michaela had already \"disarmed\" herself."],["","Turns out, no one cared about the negotiation. They were all sharpening their knives, just waiting for the other side to slip up before revealing their blades."],["","*Boom! Boom! Boom!* Rockets blasted, sending up several dust clouds as gray smoke spread across the desert. Shaken by the intense tremors, Michaela struggled on the ground for a moment before finally getting to her feet."],["Michaela Mercenary","Boss!! It's a smoke grenade! We've lost their coordinates!"],["Michaela","They can't outrun us; they'll definitely return to their STs!"],["Michaela","All members, prepare for pursuit. Don't let any of them escape, I want them alive!"]],"468329301":[["","Michaela pulls the control stick, and the Mithril's dual guns immediately aim at the Wolverine's pilot cabin. At the same time, the Wolverine raises its rail gun—but White Flame is a second too slow. Mithril has already fired, and with a piercing crash, the Wolverine's rail gun is blasted apart."],["Michaela","Stop, White Flame. You should know the consequences of hitting the pilot cabin at this range. Confrontation will only lead to your complete defeat."],["Michaela","Look around you. No matter how you struggle, you can't change this outcome. Why don't we talk again?"],["White Flame","Hmph, you're the one who flipped the negotiation table first, and now you want to \"talk\"? What kind of madness are you up to?"],["Michaela","Madness? Me flipping the table? You were the one who made the first move. I barely tested you, and you couldn't hold back. How am I supposed to believe you have nothing to do with the NDF?"],["White Flame","Heh, does every mercenary group with some power on this island have to be connected to the NDF? What about you, Michaela? Which NDF higher-up is backing you?"],["Michaela","Of course it's—"],["Michaela","Hey, that's for you to guess, White Flame. Whether I have someone backing me or who it is, I'll say the same thing—"],["Michaela","If you can't guess, I ain't telling."],["White Flame","Then what do you want?"],["Michaela","How about it?"],["","Mithril unexpectedly lowers its weapon and takes a few steps back."],["Michaela","I understand we are wary of each other. You have ill intentions, but I'm not all that honest either. Now we're even."],["Michaela","I need you to do something, and you... at least you don't hate money, right?"],["Michaela","Then let's sit down and talk again—do you want to lose everything this time, or listen to the cooperation agreement we've outlined and secure some benefits for Skyrend?"],["","On the sandy ground, the two mercenary leaders who were just fighting fiercely now sat cross-legged peacefully. Gutzman kept some distance from them and began to introduce the cooperation agreement."],["","He read the terms on the paper slowly, while Michaela and White Flame listened quietly."],["Gutzman","...And lastly, we'll set a tentative cooperation period of three months. After three months, we'll decide whether to renew based on both parties' wishes."],["Gutzman","As for the original commission distribution rules..."],["","Gutzman looked at Michaela. Previously, White Flame had raised new opinions on this agreement, but Michaela had not yet expressed her stance."],["","White Flame squinted. This is the crucial clause of the cooperation agreement. If Skyrend doesn't get a good share of the commission, wouldn't it be purely used as a tool by Michaela?"],["Michaela","Change it. What was that she was saying before?"],["Gutzman","White Flame's boss believes the commission should be distributed based on the number of people deployed by the two teams and the difficulty of the tasks undertaken."],["Michaela","Fine, that works."],["White Flame","......"],["","Did it... did it happen so easily and casually? Fortunately, with the mask covering her face, White Flame didn't appear too surprised."],["","But the fight just now made White Flame realize that Michaela is not the reckless person the rumors suggest; she must have a backup plan."],["Michaela","If your boss comes to talk to me personally—then I'll change this according to your request, and I won't argue a single word."],["White Flame","......"],["","White Flame has a headache."],["White Flame","Let me emphasize again, I am the leader of Skyrend, and there are no other rulers in Skyrend."],["Michaela","I personally bring this lucrative cooperation agreement to you, and I must ensure you won't bring me any unnecessary risks. White Flame, I know far more than you imagine."],["","White Flame silently watches Michaela."],["Michaela","You must think I'm lying, but... \"Falcon Wing\"—that name should be familiar to you, right?"],["","White Flame's eyes widened. Falcon Wing... that was the name of the enforcement team she used to be part of! How does Michaela know?"],["Michaela","Your family used to operate only in a city called Jovica on the western side of UNCS's homeland. Later, you were framed by rivals and encircled by the police, and you soon disappeared."],["","White Flame really wanted to ask, \"How do you know?\" Milkhama is far too distant from Jovica, and very few people here know her, except for her former enemies and... certain people in the UNCS."],["","White Flame quickly searched through her past memories, confirming that she had never met Michaela before, and suddenly a few ominous suspicions arose in her mind."],["Michaela","To be honest, I'm not at all surprised that you appeared on Milkhama—after all, this is a land ripe with opportunity."],["Michaela","Be it self-preservation, restoring your lineage, or gathering power for vengeance... this island offers all that you're looking for."],["White Flame","......"],["Michaela","The condition is, don't become an obstacle for the big shots."],["","White Flame's heart felt like it was being tightly clenched, contracting violently."],["White Flame","...Which side are you on?"],["","Michaela's lips curl up, followed by a burst of laughter."],["Michaela","Let's meet your boss, you'll find out soon enough."],["","Michaela suddenly leaned in close to White Flame, speaking with a playful tone only the two could hear—"],["Michaela","What will you decide?"],["Michaela","Is it to go back and tell him everything we said today word for word... or simply tell him that I, Michaela, have a big deal to discuss with him?"],["White Flame","...Is that a threat or an offer?"],["Michaela","Is there a difference? Don't forget you've already lost to me. Truth is, I don't have to go through you to reach him at all. I could just as easily have your lives end along with this conversation."],["","White Flame chuckled softly, as quickly as blowing out a candle."],["White Flame","This secret operation broke the rules. I've always known that one day someone would come knocking."],["White Flame","Where there are rules, there will always be enforcers. Those who break the rules are essentially handing over half of their lives, not knowing when the enforcer will come to claim the other half."],["White Flame","I've taken many lives and seen many enforcers. When that moment is about to come, I can sense it in advance."],["","The two stared at each other, their eyes flickering."],["Michaela","...Sounds like you're ready to face the end."],["White Flame","......"],["","They were so close that they could see the bloodshot veins in each other's eyes."],["","No. White Flame's tone was casual, but Michaela could sense the steadiness and guts in her eyes."],["White Flame","My intuition isn't always right, but assuming it is, I have a question. Since you knew he was a problem, why didn't you just catch him?"],["","Michaela's expression became subtle."],["Michaela","May I ask, boss, since you knew he was up to those tricks, why didn't you just arrest him?"],["","...To tell the truth, we lack decisive evidence."],["Michaela","Uh, uh?"],["","The intel from the informant did help us lock onto Kaylen, but this time he's hidden his tracks well."],["","If you hadn't happened to discover those gauntlets, we might still be focusing our search on the accounts under his name."],["Michaela","Can't we just find an excuse to make him cooperate with the investigation?"],["","That would definitely alert him, and he would surely find a way to secretly fill the gap he moved."],["","If we come up empty-handed, it's easy for the forces behind him to seize the opportunity and make a big deal out of it, implicating ourselves instead."],["Michaela","So you need me to...?"],["","Follow the Skyrend lead to capture Kaylen. Force him to admit that he illegally used military supplies to arm the Nightingale Task Force and privately provided military contracting services for profit."],["White Flame","Is it that you can't capture him, or you don't want to pay the cost to do so?"],["Michaela","......"],["White Flame","Heh, still apprehensive? Don't want to alert the snake, right?"],["Michaela","......"],["","Michaela shot upright, clearly displeased. She looked over at Gutzman, thinking that if he had been the one handling this, he probably could have calmly tossed the question right back at her—instead of letting White Flame nail him square in the face like she had."],["","Gutzman was baffled by the look, but his intuition told him that the whispered conversation had probably not gone well for his boss."],["Michaela","...You don't seriously think I've run out of leverage, do you?"],["White Flame","No, I'm just reminding you that I don't have to follow the path you've set for me."],["White Flame","If you kill me and my men here, even if he doesn't know how I died, he'll be more cautious, and it'll be harder for you to catch him."],["White Flame","But I can help you—just as you said, I'll keep everything that happened today a secret and bring him to you."],["Michaela","What are the terms?"],["White Flame","Once it's done, my men and I will no longer be bound by any restrictions from the NDF, nor will we face any accountability from the military."],["","Gutzman paused, his mind stirred by a few keywords. NDF? How could White Flame be connected to the NDF?"],["Michaela","NDF's constraints? Were you forced by them to work here?"],["White Flame","...He has a few documents, and if they are made public, my subordinates might face unwarranted imprisonment again."],["","Michaela hesitated, scratching her head."],["Michaela","Well, this matter..."],["White Flame","We have the whole night to consider. What'll it be, Michaela—win-win cooperation, or a fight to the death?"]],"468333101":[["","Gutzman watched expressionlessly from afar as Michaela took a call with someone unknown."],["","He couldn't hear Michaela's voice, but he could read the words \"White Flame\" from Michaela's lips—she was explaining the current situation to the person on the other end of the line."],["","—She couldn't directly agree to White Flame's request; she needed permission from whoever she was talking to..."],["","Has Harpy already spread its influence into the military?"],["","...He didn't know. He grasped a few threads of thought in his mind and gently pulled them out—only to suddenly discover that they were already connected."],["Michaela","Alright, let's get ready to discuss the next steps with White Flame."],["","Michaela ended the call and walked over. As she passed by Gutzman, he raised his hand to stop her."],["Michaela","What?"],["Gutzman","I don't think I've ever really understood our team... Were you just on the phone with someone from Harpy?"],["Michaela","Why would I be?"],["","Michaela answered casually. She now considered Gutzman one of her own, and spoke without reservation."],["Michaela","White Flame wants to make a clean getaway after the plan succeeds; she even wants to take the criminal records of her subordinates with her. I don't know exactly what they did wrong, so I'll have to ask the boss first."],["Michaela","The boss checked and said that the cases White Flame and her team are involved in are a bit suspicious and can be manipulated."],["Gutzman","Who is the boss?"],["Michaela","Ha, I can't say that outright. Maybe next time, if there's a chance, I can introduce you two. She's actually quite nice."],["Gutzman","…The military?"],["","Michaela raised an eyebrow."],["Michaela","Not bad. Quick on the uptake, aren't you? Last time you were still saying the boss was from Harpy."],["Michaela","I gave you so many hints, and finally you reacted. Although the answer is still a bit far from the truth, it's close enough."],["","Gutzman's Adam's apple moved as his gaze swept from left to right, but he didn't take anything in."],["Gutzman","…Have you been lying to me all along?"],["Michaela","Huh? What are you thinking? I'm not lying to you. Everything you perceive is just what you think it is. I'm telling the truth, and there's no manipulation involved."],["Gutzman","......"],["Michaela","Why the long face? You're disappointed? You should be happy, Gutzman. With the military as our backer, we'll have plenty of resources and face strong opponents to hone our skills."],["","Gutzman remained silent."],["","Michaela is passionate about challenges, always seeking stronger enemies, so she doesn't care if the military sees her as a useful tool or a compliant dog."],["","She also doesn't understand Gutzman's worries and hatred."],["Michaela","Give me a response, Advisor. If you don't speak up, I'm leaving. I've got work to do!"],["Gutzman","I don't like it."],["","Michaela had only taken a couple of steps when Gutzman suddenly spoke up behind her."],["Michaela","Did you have a grudge against the NDF before?"],["Gutzman","I don't have a good impression of government people. If they hadn't landed on the island, I would probably still be in the northwest forest hunting and fishing every day to pass the time."],["Gutzman","If we'd met there, we wouldn't have had to size each other up over the barrels of our guns. If you're not fussy about food, I'd have fried you up some smoked meat and poured you a cup of my old man's homebrewed ale."],["Michaela","Oh, your previous life sounds a bit dull—uh, but as long as you like it."],["","Michaela accidentally spoke her mind, and seeing Gutzman's displeased expression, she quickly changed her tune."],["Gutzman","Whether I liked it or not, it's gone now."],["Michaela","Because the people on the island prefer waging war to passing time hunting and fishing?"],["Gutzman","This is not something to joke about."],["Michaela","I'm just stating a fact... Haha, sometimes when a fact goes beyond the norm, your first reaction might not be surprise, but rather to laugh."],["Michaela","You know, I participated in the Milkhama war before."],["Gutzman","I've heard about it."],["Michaela","I was serving in the NDF at the time. During one operation, I got trapped underground with a DLAF Soldier. For the first few days, we fought fiercely, but eventually, both of us were exhausted and had no choice but to hang on and wait for rescue."],["Michaela","Waited for many days, but the rescue signal never appeared. My situation was terrible, and I was the first to collapse, falling into a coma."],["Michaela","Before I lost consciousness, I thought my life was over. How could I pass out in front of the enemy? But later... Damn it! Standing here alive in front of you makes this story completely lack suspense!"],["Gutzman","In short, he saved you."],["Michaela","Yes, that's right. That kid secretly saved the last sip of water and used it to wet a rag to cool me down."],["Gutzman","What's the reason?"],["Michaela","He didn't say. Later, I visited his home, and it was his sister who opened the door for me. Haha, a big beauty, fierce and bold."],["Michaela","That guy is a two-meter giant, but when I asked, I found out he's three years younger than me."],["Gutzman","Is he dead?"],["Michaela","He's dead."],["","Michaela mimics a gun gesture."],["Michaela","That shot was clean, and the pose was really cool. He only had time to widen his eyes, not even enough to speak."],["","Gutzman tugged at the corner of his mouth."],["Gutzman","Ruthless..."],["Michaela","Ha, the one who saved us was my NDF comrade—if that kid hadn't died there, it would've been hard for him to die later."],["Gutzman","..."],["Michaela","Tsk, isn't it funny? We survived underground for so many days, but once we were rescued, someone had to end up dead."],["Michaela","Haha. Funny, isn't it?"],["","She said this, but there wasn't a trace of humor in her tone, expression, or deep in her eyes. It was the first time Gutzman saw her narrate something so plainly."],["Michaela","Don't you think this island is just a wasteland? Gutzman, it exists outside the land of normal order. Here, only humans whose beastly nature hasn't been extinguished can live with gusto. This is the survival rule it has set for everyone."],["Michaela","And the UNCS and DL, the two fiercest beasts on the island—follow their footprints and we'll find the bloodiest feast..."],["Gutzman","And that's what you're after."],["Michaela","Don't give me that adviser act. If you didn't have an ambitious bone in your body, you'd be lounging around somewhere on the mainland by now, living the retired life."],["Gutzman","I've always lived here, Michaela. My parents and grandparents lived here. Don't attribute all my efforts for survival to my 'ambition.'"],["Michaela","......"],["","Michaela gave a small smile, and after breaking eye contact with Gutzman, gradually smoothed the corners of her mouth."],["Michaela","I don't care about the psychological activities of my subordinates. Whether you're driven by survival, ambition, or something else, it doesn't matter to me. I only care if you can perform your expected role."],["Michaela","But there's one thing you must understand, Milkhama is no longer the Milkhama it used to be. It can make your life miserable, or it can make it joyful."],["Michaela","Don't like the military? Fine. When you become stronger than them, go ahead and take them down. If you're strong enough, you can change many things, and do what you like."],["Michaela","Until then, just sharpen your claws with everything you can get your hands on."],["","Michaela approached Gutzman, patted his shoulder, and quickly passed by."],["","Gutzman stood solemnly in place, watching her leave. As the sky darkened, the ground began to stir up yellow sand, gradually obscuring his outline."],["White Flame","I have ten minutes to go. How's your preparation?"],["Michaela","Not great. Why did he suddenly change the location? If you hadn't informed us in advance, we wouldn't have had time to set up."],["White Flame","It's normal. He doesn't trust you, fearing he might be ambushed, so he changed the location at the last minute to ensure you don't have time to make any moves."],["White Flame","He's always been this cautious. We rarely meet, usually only communicating through a single line."],["Michaela","Won't he change his mind again at the last minute?"],["White Flame","Given his interest in the cooperation agreement Gutzman laid out, I think he will still consider your feelings."],["White Flame","Changing the meeting location once can be seen as cautious, but twice is provocation."],["Michaela","Alright, I'll talk to you later. I need to keep an eye on the setup here."],["White Flame","Wait, Michaela."],["Michaela","Anything else you want to remind me of?"],["White Flame","I just want to remind you... don't forget our trade."],["Michaela","Heh... of course, haven't you already got half of those documents?"],["Michaela","As for the other half... it all depends on today."],["","Michaela tossed the communicator into her pocket and skillfully jumped from the rooftop to the ground, using the protruding steel bars and windowsills."],["","Their agreed meeting place was an abandoned repair shop in the desert's no-man's land. Five minutes ago, they rushed here to set up an ambush, planning to capture Kaylen alive."],["Michaela Mercenary","Boss, the brothers have prepared as you said. However, to avoid a collapse, a few landmine points from the concept have been changed. This is the completion status of the preparations, take a look."],["","The underling handed over a terminal filled with small writing. Michaela felt overwhelmed at first glance but forced herself to read it all."],["Michaela","Very... good, let's go with this. Have the retreat routes in this area been thoroughly explored?"],["Michaela Mercenary","No problem, people have already been sent to guard them."],["Michaela","Excellent work."],["Gutzman","Michaela, I see Skyrend's team."],["","Gutzman's message suddenly came through. He's lying in wait on the other side, ready for the opportunity."],["Michaela","Here so soon? Then hurry up! Everyone get back into the STs and don't show any weaknesses!"],["","Michaela climbed the rope ladder back into the cockpit of Mithril, and soon a group of STs appeared on the horizon, among them the Wolverine that Michaela was very familiar with."],["","At the forefront of the team is a Thanatos, which should be the ST piloted by Kaylen."],["","When the two teams completely faced each other, Michaela pulled the control stick, and Mithril slowly moved forward."],["Michaela","Nice to meet you, leader of Skyrend."],["Michaela","I'm Michaela, may I know your name?"],["Kaylen","Nice to meet you, Michaela, just call me Derek."],["","Michaela felt relieved. Before taking action, Naomi had given her information on Kaylen to confirm his identity, which included this guy's voiceprint. The voiceprint matched, indicating that the person sitting inside the Thanatos is indeed Kaylen."],["Michaela","Alright, Derek, it's not quite right for us to just stand here and chat. How about we sit down and have a proper talk?"],["Kaylen","......"],["Michaela","Ah, I know you're very cautious, Derek. Honestly, working with someone like you gives me peace of mind. You can avoid the dangers I might overlook early on, reducing some unnecessary losses."],["","Michaela musters her limited patience, racking her brain for words of persuasion."],["Michaela","But since we've decided to cooperate well, we'll inevitably be in frequent contact in the future."],["Michaela","For collaboration, we don't require knowing each other inside out, but at least we should have met, right?"],["Kaylen","...You're right, Michaela."],["","The cockpit door of Thanatos opens a crack, with white mist swirling into vortex-like patterns."],["Kaylen","The most important prerequisite for cooperation is sincerity, and I understand this basic courtesy."],["","The cockpit door is fully open."],["Kaylen?","It's a pity we can't sit in some tavern and have a good chat—no better way to seal a deal than a toast."],["Michaela","—!!"],["","Michaela's eyes widened, this guy, this guy!"],["","Although it's a bit far away, Michaela can still see the general appearance—this guy is definitely not Kaylen!"],["","Her mind was exploding with thoughts. What's going on? Did Kaylen become overly cautious and find a double, or did he team up with White Flame to set her up?"],["","Or, or..."],["Kaylen?","What's wrong, boss Michaela? I've already shown my sincerity—you wouldn't happen to be scared, would you?"],["Michaela","...Haha, not a chance. I just think you resemble a friend of mine."],["","Michaela uses both hands, one to open the hatch and the other to send a message. Her movements are very light, because at this moment she is still communicating with \"Kaylen\" through wireless communication between STs, and any operational movements she makes could arouse suspicion."],["Michaela","I feel a connection with you—I think this exchange might be quite pleasant."],["","Gutzman holds a cigarette in his mouth, unlit. The cockpit's control equipment is quite delicate, and it's hard to clean up if ash falls."],["","He sat hunched for a long time, then changed his posture. After a while, he furrowed his brow and changed his posture again."],["Recruit","Boss, are we just gonna sit here and wait?"],["Gutzman","......"],["Recruit","Boss? Are you still there?"],["Gutzman","What are you talking about? Of course I'm here."],["Recruit","Oh, you didn't respond, so I thought you fell asleep! I just wanted to ask if we're just gonna sit here and wait, doing nothing."],["Recruit","From what I see, Michaela doesn't want us involved at all."],["Recruit","They've made so many preparations at the negotiation site that if things really kick off, Skyrend will have more than enough to deal with. Are we even needed?"],["Recruit","They say they treat us as their own, but they're just using us—"],["","Gutzman frowned, about to tell him to shut up, when suddenly Michaela's message came through."],["","\"Hostile Decoy, Signal Tracking!\""],["","He had not even worked out what that meant when another piece of code came through in a hurry. Gutzman recognized the format. It was a communications key."],["Recruit","But fortunately, working with her hasn't cost us anything. I wonder what kind of backing she has. To think she actually—"],["Gutzman","Don't disturb me."],["","—His subordinates finally quieted down. But Gutzman's brow furrowed deeper and deeper as he hesitated to enter the communication key into the system. Less than ten seconds later, he heard a mysterious woman."],["","Michaela? Did the operation go wrong?"],["Gutzman","......"],["","Gutzman opened his mouth, unsure of what to say for a moment—this woman might be from the military, and he never had anything good to say to military personnel. But Michaela's message was so urgent, she must be in dire need of her support."],["","...And you are?"],["","He didn't speak, and the other person's voice immediately turned cold."],["Gutzman","...Gutzman, I'm Gutzman, Michaela's advisor."],["Gutzman","She is on a mission and seems to have encountered some trouble. Got the code \"Hostile Decoy, Signal Tracking,\" and the key to contact you."],["","......"],["","Gutzman heard rapid typing on the keyboard, which was different from the soldiers he usually encountered. After staying in a place like Milkhama for a long time, even the most rigid soldiers would pick up a bit of a rogue spirit, always cursing first when something happened."],["","But this woman showed enough calmness and professionalism from the moment she answered the call, and she was also decisive."],["","\"I think we can add a section about bonuses to the agreement...\""],["","A strange male voice comes through the communication."],["","I accessed Mithril's communication system and tracked the current conversation partner with Michaela. Hmph, the voice is indeed Kaylen."],["","Gutzman is startled, unable to comprehend the means required to achieve such a level of reverse tracking."],["","He used Thanatos as a relay station to transmit his signal, creating the illusion that he was speaking on the ST, when in fact the decoy was just lip-syncing."],["","Gutzman's eyes lit up as he received a brand new marked map, with a red dot flashing in the corner."],["","The coverage of the relay station's signal is limited, Kaylen can't be too far away... This map is a scan of the surrounding area."],["","I found this transmission point based on the signal records received by Thanatos. It's continuously transmitting signals, most likely our target."],["","Gutzman placed the cigarette behind his ear, sat up straight, and his bones, stiff for too long, made a dull cracking sound."],["Gutzman","Received. We're moving out."],["Kaylen","Logistics and supply aren't Skyrend's specialty, so we'll leave that part to you."],["Michaela","Kai... Derek, if I remember correctly, you just meant that tactical reconnaissance and equipment support are our tasks, right?"],["Michaela","The remaining logistics and supply are also up to us... Well, that's interesting. Are you planning to go straight to the front line and reap the rewards?"],["Kaylen","Heh, I'm just acknowledging the combat abilities of you and your subordinates, Michaela."],["Kaylen","The key to cooperation is everyone doing their part. The firepower that Skyrend possesses can only be fully unleashed on the battlefield where it truly belongs."],["Michaela","...Tsk, Kaylen, if you were in front of me right now, I'd have to knock out one of your front teeth to settle this."],["Kaylen","What are you talking about—"],["","With a thunderous roar, the continuous vibrations jolted Kaylen."],["","What's going on?! This gas station has been abandoned for years. At a time like this, no one would show up except him!"],["","—But Michaela just called out his real name. Could it be..."],["Michaela","Heh heh, have they arrived?"],["","Kaylen's face changed, quickly maneuvering Thanatos out of the gas station, only to find a circle of unfamiliar STs surrounding them."],["","The Gillesrais raised its gun forward, and Kaylen heard a stranger's voice."],["Gutzman","Target confirmed, ready to engage."],["","Cold sweat trickled down Kaylen's forehead, but he still managed a smile."],["Kaylen","Heh... You shouldn't have come here."],["","The Gillesrais detected a large number of approaching heat sources—Gutzman sensed something was wrong. However, it was too late to withdraw, so he had to resort to shielding in an attempt to block the fireballs falling from the sky."],["","The intense tremor caused a brief blur on the display screen inside the pilot cabin. Gutzman quickly locked onto the source of the launch—on the screen, a massive quadrupedal ST was slowly approaching them."],["Kaylen","I'm not unprepared either, haha. Since you're determined to meet your end, I don't mind granting you that wish."],["Gutzman","......"],["Gutzman","Alright, boys, looks like we've got a tough fight ahead."]],"468333301":[["","Gutzman grabbed Kaylen from the pilot cabin and threw him to the ground. Even though the Thanatos had fallen, the height from the cabin to the ground was still considerable. Hitting the ground, Kaylen spat out a few muffled curses into the dust."],["Gutzman","Hurry over here, we've caught the person. Let's see how you handle it."],["","Gutzman jumped down and sent a message to Michaela in the distance."],["Kaylen","Who are you people? Why did you attack me?!"],["","Kaylen's two hands were already bound, and he was surrounded by a group of burly mercenaries. Despite the cold sweat streaming down, he still tried to maintain his composure."],["Kaylen","I want to negotiate with your leader. You will regret what you've done today, you will regret attacking me!"],["","Gutzman clicked his tongue and slowly walked towards him, his subordinates automatically parted to create a path, allowing Gutzman to reach Kaylen."],["Gutzman","Are you from the military too?"],["Kaylen","You don't know me? Why are you arresting me if you don't know me—ugh!!"],["","Gutzman grabbed Kaylen's cheeks and dragged him in front of himself, then looked him up and down with a mocking smile."],["Gutzman","Interesting."],["Kaylen","W-what... does this mean..."],["Gutzman","Heh, annoying bunch."],["","Gutzman gives a casual shove, causing Kaylen to stagger back a few steps and fall."],["Kaylen","Who are you?! Are you with Michaela or not?!"],["Gutzman","Does it matter if we're together? Anyway, you can't escape now, you can only wait for judgment."],["","Kaylen grits his teeth fiercely, showing a sinister expression."],["Kaylen","No matter who you are... brother, I'm an officer of the UNCS Coastal Defense Force! If you let me go, I promise you won't regret it!"],["","Gutzman didn't say a word, took the cigarette from his ear, looked around, and casually found a still-burning fire to light it."],["Kaylen","I'm telling the truth, brother! Aren't you guys out here for money? I've got plenty of it! How much do you want? Just say it! How much will it take for you to let me go now?"],["","Gutzman took a deep drag on his cigarette and looked down at Kaylen. This was truly an unprecedented experience—he had captured a UNCS officer, and the officer was spinelessly begging him for mercy."],["Gutzman","Hehehe..."],["Kaylen","Why are you laughing? You still don't believe me? If you don't believe me, you can let go of my hand first. I'll pay a portion of the deposit, and once I'm safe—"],["Gutzman","In the blink of an eye, so many years have passed, officer."],["Kaylen","...? Do we... know each other?"],["Gutzman","No, we don't. I just remembered a police officer I met years ago... To protect my business from mercenaries, I offered all my assets to ask for his help."],["Gutzman","Back then, I wasn't as impressive as I am now, able to take on any team... At that time, I was powerless against any team and could only seek help from those who were capable."],["Gutzman","Unfortunately, I trusted the wrong person, and in the end... haha, even caused the entire village to become homeless."],["","Gutzman approached Kaylen again."],["Gutzman","Later, I kept wondering why that officer took my money but still wanted to kill me."],["Kaylen","......"],["Gutzman","We used to be on good terms, and his meager salary could never support his extravagance. I secretly supported him for years, yet when he joined outsiders to shoot at me, he didn't hesitate for a moment."],["Gutzman","Officer, what do you think the reason could be?"],["Kaylen","..."],["Kaylen","You don't need to tell these stories to imply anything to me. I know you have concerns, afraid I might want to kill you to silence you... I understand, I completely understand your worries."],["Kaylen","I promise you... never mind, I know you won't believe me. How about this, you withdraw me first, and we'll go to a place where we won't be disturbed—"],["Kaylen","You decide the location, and once we're there, I'll give you a satisfactory amount. You just leave me a communicator and don't worry about anything else, how does that sound?"],["Gutzman","......"],["","Swirling smoke danced between Gutzman and Kaylen. Kaylen couldn't see the other's expression, but the silence suggested that the other might really be considering the terms he proposed."],["Kaylen","...Six figures."],["","Gutzman said nothing."],["Kaylen","...Seven."],["","Gutzman raised an eyebrow and chuckled."],["Gutzman","A coastal defense officer with that kind of net worth? Now that's something I never thought I'd see."],["Kaylen","You're still not satisfied?!"],["","Kaylen lowered his voice, somewhat exasperated."],["","Before Gutzman could respond, the ground was already shaking with the distinctive vibrations of ST movement—they immediately realized that this deal might end before it even began."],["Kaylen","Hey! Hey!! Bro, I'm serious, I'm not lying to you! I really can give you that much money—!"],["","Gutzman lowered his eyes, pushing Kaylen forward with his hands bound behind him. His Mithril had already stopped, and the pilot's hatch was slowly opening."],["Gutzman","...Boss."],["","Gutzman speaks softly, his gaze fixed intently on the distance—Michaela is descending on a rope ladder, and halfway down, she's so filled with euphoria that she jumps off and runs over."],["","—Tsk... This woman is still as thoughtless as ever."],["Gutzman","Actually, I came to understand later."],["Kaylen","W-What did you say?"],["","Kaylen's heart was pounding like a drum at the thought of being handed over to Michaela. That woman might have been sent by some political enemy to mess with him. At this moment, thinking of a way to escape was the serious business, and he had no intention of analyzing what Gutzman was trying to express."],["Gutzman","He was just someone else's prey—"],["","Kaylen's heart was about to leap into his throat, but suddenly he felt his two hands come free behind his back. A cold, hard sensation filled his palms. It was a gun."],["Michaela","Shit! Gutzman! What are you dawdling for! Hurry—!"],["","Gutzman saw Michaela running towards him, his mind went blank, but he still wanted to say something—bang! bang! Two gunshots replaced his voice first."],["","Everything seemed to stretch out, longer than any slow-motion scene he had ever seen in a movie."],["","He saw Michaela stop rushing forward and slowly cover her waist, her expression filled with disbelief."],["","Of course she would be in disbelief. Their collaboration had been pleasant all this time, and with her mindset, she probably never anticipated this moment."],["","It was hard to anticipate that the advisor she trusted so much would unexpectedly join forces with the enemy and shoot at her without any sign..."],["Michaela","!?"],["","Michaela quickly draws a gun from her waist. Gutzman is surprised, yet oddly relieved."],["","Yeah, that's Michaela... She never gives up the fight, even when she's been hit by two bullets, with wounds bleeding profusely and pain brutally pounding her nerves... She will resolutely pull out her gun."],["","Doesn't she feel pain? Gutzman staggered back a few steps, thinking in a daze."],["","...How could she not feel pain?"],["","Gutzman's vision suddenly became incredibly blurred, and he looked down to find his abdomen was a deep red."],["","His hand touched it, feeling a warm, moist, and sticky sensation, one he was all too familiar with... He had touched countless others, and now he finally touched his own."],["","All at once, the strength went out of his lower body. His legs folded beneath him, and he dropped to his knees. Blood streamed along the lines of his body, surging away as though it were taking his life with it. His thoughts began to drift."],["???","Gutzman!!!"],["","Who's on his radar? Who's calling him?"],["???","Stay awake! Gutzman! Don't fall asleep! Gutzman!!"],["","Who... who is it?"],["","Gutzman...you're going to...apologize to the ancestors...for all the mess you've made..."],["","I did nothing wrong. Without me, we would've been dragged into the war and be homeless all the same!"],["","I just want everyone to have food to eat and a place to sleep. What did I do wrong?"],["","You... *cough, cough*! You... you—you—you heartless—bastard—!!"],["Douglas","...Kill Georgia? Huh, hearing that suggestion from you is really unsettling. Why did you suddenly fall out with Georgia?"],["Gutzman","This isn't a trap, don't worry. It's just that the two of us have different ideas."],["Douglas","Yeah, you've finally awakened, brother. Georgia is just a freak, full of hypocritical talk, not genuine."],["Douglas","If you've already decided to break up with her, I'd certainly welcome you to join my team, but—"],["Douglas","Can you really bring yourself to kill Georgia?"],["Georgia","If this is your well-considered decision, I have no objections. If you want to leave, just go."],["Gutzman","…Georgia, you should know, I actually don't want to leave the Iguanas, I…"],["Georgia","Since you've already made the decision, there's no need to explain further."],["Gutzman","......"],["Gutzman","Georgia, I want you to know that I've always wanted the Iguanas to find their footing and grow stronger. Even now, my feelings toward the Iguanas haven't changed."],["Georgia","Heh... Do you really want the Iguanas to grow stronger, or do you want the Iguanas to support you to grow stronger?"],["Gutzman","...You have always deeply misunderstood me, Georgia."],["Georgia","I'm just a rational person capable of thought, Gutzman. I know you..."],["Georgia","Forget it, it's useless to say more. You can go."],["","Alright, I'm leaving. Let me know when he wakes up or passes away."],["","Uh... Okay, boss Michaela..."],["","......"],["","Michaela?"],["","Hey! Wait, wait a minute! Boss Michaela! Our boss just furrowed his brow! He seems to be conscious!"],["","Huh? Let me see, let me see!"],["","Well... so noisy."],["","Hey, so he is. That brow's so tightly furrowed, a mosquito couldn't even squeeze a leg in."],["Gutzman","...Don't... disturb me."],["Michaela","Well... Wake up, hey, wake up, Gutzman."],["","Gutzman has a splitting headache and slowly opens his eyes—he's lying on a hospital bed, with his own people standing on the left, and on the right..."],["Michaela","Do you still recognize your boss? Who am I?"],["Gutzman","......"],["","Gutzman takes a deep breath, just about to speak when he feels a dull pain in his abdomen."],["Michaela","Don't exert yourself, the wound hasn't healed yet, and there's more suffering to come."],["Gutzman","...Where is that guy?"],["Michaela","Which one? Oh, the one who shot at you, Kaylen, right? Tsk... I told you not to be too disappointed, he's not dead."],["Michaela","He shot at you twice, then I shot him in the arm, and he was subdued."],["Michaela","I handed him over to the boss, who said someone upstairs wants to protect him, so... he'll probably just get a demotion."],["","Gutzman heard this and smirked, saying nothing."],["Michaela","You, such a big guy, can't even control a small-framed fellow like that, and you let him snatch your weapon. Aren't you ashamed?"],["Michaela","You got lucky this time. The doctor said you nearly died, but \"nearly\" is the key word there. Tsk, tsk. Guess it takes more than that to kill a guy like you."],["Gutzman","...Heh."],["Michaela","Heh-heh-heh... Enjoy your laughter while you can, there won't be many days left to laugh. Once I wrap things up here, we'll have to set out again—hey brother, go ask the doctor how many more IV bags he still has to get through today."],["Gutzman Mercenary","Yes, ma'am."],["","Michaela helped to speed up the drip rate, as if doing so could accelerate Gutzman's healing."],["","Gutzman slowly fumbled under the blanket until he felt the touch of the handgun and stopped. It's his habit to always have a gun nearby, and fortunately, his subordinates always remember."],["Michaela","How is it? Are you enjoying working with this boss? Isn't he different from those annoying guys you've encountered before?"],["Gutzman","...What exactly are you helping them with?"],["Michaela","I told you from the start—I want to integrate all the mercenary organizations in West Milkhama, and then continue to spread eastward... I want to create the strongest mercenary team in Milkhama."],["Gutzman","..."],["Gutzman","The east and west are on the verge of war. How can you be sure you're not being used to achieve some bigwigs' strategic plans?"],["Michaela","There's no need to confirm, Gutzman, it's obvious. In Milkhama, the ones who can manipulate the situation at the table are those guys—we're just minions, pawns."],["Michaela","But there's no reason we have to accept that role... Gutzman, we can also use them to achieve our own goals."],["","Gutzman's lips moved slightly, but he hesitated to speak. Michaela smiled and pulled up a chair to sit by the bedside."],["Michaela","You've been more fussy lately, Advisor... Still stuck on the same issue?"],["Michaela","Tsk, before Kaylen fired—"],["","Gutzman gently placed his right hand on the gun's grip."],["Michaela","You seem to have something to say. What did you want to tell me back then?"],["","Gutzman fell silent once more. His memory rewound to the moment of cutting the rope, or perhaps even further back."],["","He was shocked by the scene he witnessed that day, meticulously approached Michaela to become her advisor, scheming for her funds, technology, and team, planning to make a comeback someday."],["","At that time, his gun was already aimed at Michaela from behind Kaylen, ready to fire the bullet that could pierce Michaela's heart and then frame Kaylen, allowing him to use this as leverage to seamlessly take Michaela's place and achieve his original goal."],["","But at the critical moment, he hesitated."],["Gutzman","Nothing to say, just reminiscing about the past..."],["","Thinking back, he lost everything he was obsessed with, and almost everything he wanted to do ended in failure."],["","—Then is the decision I'm making now the right one? Continuing to walk along the fixed orbit for years, making no change, stubbornly moving forward... is it right?"],["","Kill Michaela, take her team, keep taking jobs, making money, dealing with enemies... and then perhaps one day, nothing remains again... the cycle repeats."],["Gutzman","Heh..."],["Michaela","Why did you start talking to yourself and then laugh? Should I not interrupt your self-mockery time?"],["Gutzman","You're right, Michaela."],["Michaela","...Then should I go?"],["","Gutzman looked out the window. It was a beautiful day, with the sun shining brightly outside. Though he was lying in the hospital, he could still smell the lingering scent of gunpowder in the air."],["Gutzman","Milkhama will soon no longer accommodate ordinary wishes... Only the fiercest beasts can live with gusto."],["Michaela","Have you finally figured it out? Accepted it?"],["Gutzman","But Michaela, where will we ultimately end up by following their footprints?"],["Michaela","......"],["Michaela","I don't know, Gutzman, I only know that bastards like us, with our wicked deeds, won't have a good end."],["Michaela","I can't escape that end, but I can choose how to reach it—leaving Milkhama and smuggling myself to the continent, finding some random place to die of old age is not the ending I want."],["Michaela","I want to die on the most spectacular battlefield, holding a weapon in my one remaining arm, firing the last bullet... fighting my opponents until my last heartbeat fades."],["Gutzman","...Heh, something you would do."],["Michaela","So I would never lie in a hospital bed doubting myself like you do now. As long as I'm alive, I'll find the next opponent, defeat them, then find the next opponent, defeat them, and then find..."],["Gutzman","Stop."],["Michaela","Until I can no longer find the next opponent... or I die."],["Gutzman","*chuckle... cough! cough, cough—!* Ah... Do you think you'll live to see that day?"],["Michaela","...If that day comes, do you think Milkhama will be under my command from then on?"],["","Gutzman withdrew his gaze from the window and turned to meet Michaela's eyes. They stared at each other calmly and silently... Some words don't need to be spoken."],["Gutzman","If that day ever comes, remember to help me deal with my enemies. Those who want to chop me up could line up from the East Coast all the way to the West Coast."],["Michaela","Come on, deal with your own troubles. But I can help collect your body—where do you want to be buried?"],["Gutzman","...You can leave now, I have a headache."],["","Michaela laughed heartily and left in a whirlwind, just as she had arrived."],["","A sudden chill invaded the ward as the thickening clouds outside blocked the sunlight. Gutzman gazed at the mass of gray-white clouds, watching them drift slowly into the distance."],["","He slowly reached his right hand out from under the covers and adjusted the drip speed to be a bit faster."],["Michaela Mercenary","Boss, is the job done? Do you need me to go in and help with the body?"],["Michaela","What are you thinking in that head of yours?"],["Michaela Mercenary","No body?! Then how did you deal with Gutzman, boss?"],["Michaela","Didn't do anything special, he's still alive and well."],["Michaela Mercenary","What?! Boss, that guy is—"],["","The subordinate looked around, leaned closer to Michaela, and lowered his voice."],["Michaela Mercenary","We've checked the rope that tied Kaylen. The angle and neatness of the cut make it impossible for Kaylen to have done it himself."],["Michaela","I know, you've already reported it once."],["Michaela Mercenary","Then! Then Gutzman is the most suspicious! He might have wanted to team up with Kaylen to take you down, boss!"],["Michaela","......"],["","Michaela didn't answer immediately, just looked up at the window of Gutzman's ward, chuckled, and walked forward."],["Michaela Mercenary","Boss?"],["Michaela","Gutzman is an extremely difficult opponent. We already lost once last time. Do you think I would push him to the opposite side again in a short time without a guarantee of victory?"],["Michaela Mercenary","Uh, this..."],["Michaela","No matter the reason, he didn't make a move at that time... Ha, it seems we can still make use of his brain for a while longer."],["Michaela Mercenary","Although that's indeed what was said..."],["Michaela","Stop wasting time here, the White Flame matter is still waiting for us to help the boss wrap it up, let's go!"],["Michaela Mercenary","Alright... uh! Boss! Wait for me!"]]};
